{"id":"tissu","lemma":"tissu","pos":"noun","rank":2830,"glosses":["fabric","tissue"],"ipa":"/ti.sy/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/Fr-tissu.ogg/Fr-tissu.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tissus"},"formAudio":{"tissus":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-tissus.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce tissu s'étire facilement.","en":"This material stretches easily.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to stretch","l":"étirer"},{"g":"easily"}]},{"text":"Voici un échantillon du tissu que je veux.","en":"Here's a sample of the material I want.","words":[{"g":"here is"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sample, extract"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"}]},{"text":"Ce tissu est vraiment doux et soyeux.","en":"This cloth is really smooth and silky.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"truly"},{"g":"sweet"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"silky"}]},{"text":"Coupez le tissu en diagonale.","en":"Cut the cloth diagonally.","words":[{"g":"to cut, cut up","l":"couper"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"cursorily"]]},{"text":"Ses vêtements étaient faits de tissu très bon marché.","en":"Her clothes were made of very cheap material.","words":[{"g":"his"},{"g":"garment","l":"vêtement"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"done","l":"fait"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"very"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"cheap, inexpensive"]]}]}